---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from './PageHeader.astro';
import Callout from './Callout.astro';
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.astro';

interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'id' }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const id = lang === 'id';
---

<DocsLayout title={id ? 'Memulai' : 'Getting Started'}>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Quick start"
    title={id ? 'Dari container sampai pesan pertama' : 'From container to first message'}
    description={id
      ? 'Jalur production paling pendek: jalankan container, buka dashboard pada domain Wago, Pair WhatsApp, lalu gunakan generated API key untuk integrasi.'
      : 'The shortest production path: start the container, open the dashboard on the Wago domain, Pair WhatsApp, then use the generated API key for integrations.'}
  />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">1. {id ? 'Prasyarat' : 'Prerequisites'}</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-8">
    <li>Docker Engine + Docker Compose v2.</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Satu akun WhatsApp yang dapat membuka Linked devices.' : 'One WhatsApp account that can access Linked devices.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Satu domain HTTPS melalui reverse proxy, tunnel, atau router PaaS untuk deployment publik.' : 'One HTTPS domain through a reverse proxy, tunnel, or PaaS router for public deployment.'}</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">2. {id ? 'Clone dan jalankan' : 'Clone and start'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`git clone https://github.com/howlil/wago.git\ncd wago\ndocker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose ps\ncurl http://127.0.0.1:3000/health`} />
  <Callout title={id ? 'Tidak perlu .env' : 'No .env required'}>
    {id
      ? 'docker-compose.yml production tidak meminta CORS_ORIGIN atau API_KEY. Compose bind ke 127.0.0.1:3000; reverse proxy/tunnel cukup meneruskan domain HTTPS publik ke service tersebut.'
      : 'The production docker-compose.yml does not ask for CORS_ORIGIN or API_KEY. Compose binds to 127.0.0.1:3000; the reverse proxy/tunnel only needs to forward the public HTTPS domain to that service.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">3. {id ? 'Pair WhatsApp dan buat credential' : 'Pair WhatsApp and create credentials'}</h2>
  <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-4">
    <li>{id ? 'Buka dashboard dari domain publik Wago.' : 'Open the dashboard from the public Wago domain.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Klik Pair WhatsApp. Pada fresh gateway, browser otomatis membuat kandidat API key random dan bootstrap credential dari origin Wago yang terdeteksi.' : 'Click Pair WhatsApp. On a fresh gateway, the browser automatically creates a random API-key candidate and bootstraps the credential from the detected Wago origin.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Backend menyimpan App ID dan SHA-256 hash key di volume. Raw API key tetap di browser dan ditampilkan agar dapat disalin untuk client REST eksternal.' : 'The backend stores the App ID and SHA-256 key hash in the volume. The raw API key remains in the browser and is shown so it can be copied for external REST clients.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Buka WhatsApp → Linked devices → Link a device dan scan QR.' : 'Open WhatsApp → Linked devices → Link a device and scan the QR.'}</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mb-8">{id ? 'Setelah gateway pernah diinisialisasi, first-run bootstrap tidak membuat key pengganti. Browser baru harus menggunakan existing API key atau cookie session yang valid.' : 'After the gateway has been initialized, first-run bootstrap does not create a replacement key. A new browser must use the existing API key or a valid session cookie.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">4. {id ? 'Izinkan recipient' : 'Allow a recipient'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Recipient dapat di-allow dari dashboard, atau melalui REST API berikut.' : 'A recipient can be allowed from the dashboard, or through the REST API below.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`export WAGO_URL="https://wago.example.com"\nexport WAGO_API_KEY="wa_your-generated-api-key"\n\ncurl -X POST "$WAGO_URL/recipients/allow" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"phone":"6281234567890","label":"Demo recipient"}'`} />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">5. {id ? 'Kirim pesan' : 'Send a message'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Gunakan form Send Message di dashboard atau endpoint API.' : 'Use the Send Message form in the dashboard or the API endpoint.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`curl -X POST "$WAGO_URL/messages/send" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -H "Idempotency-Key: demo-001" \\\n  -d '{"to":"6281234567890","text":"Hello from Wago"}'`} />
  <Callout title={id ? 'Arti HTTP 202' : 'What HTTP 202 means'} tone="warning">
    {id ? 'Response 202/pending berarti operasi outbound diterima oleh layer Wago/Baileys. Ini bukan bukti pesan sudah delivered atau read.' : 'A 202/pending response means the outbound operation was accepted by the Wago/Baileys layer. It is not proof that the message was delivered or read.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">6. {id ? 'Cek status dan activity' : 'Check status and activity'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`curl "$WAGO_URL/messages/<message-id>/status" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY"\n\ncurl "$WAGO_URL/activity?limit=20" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY"`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">{id ? 'Message status bersifat transient dan hilang saat proses restart. Activity log operator disimpan secara persisten di /app/data/activity-log.json dengan batas 300 event.' : 'Message status is transient and is lost when the process restarts. The operator activity log is persisted at /app/data/activity-log.json and capped at 300 events.'}</p>
</DocsLayout>
